  - cli: Copilot
    version: 1.0.80
    last_updated: 2026-04-17
    notes:
      - "Source: Copilot model picker output supplied by user"
      - "2026-08-26: version re-probed as 1.0.80. Model list NOT re-verified - the CLI has no models subcommand, an invalid --model reports availability without enumerating, and the shipped app.js carries no catalog. The list is fetched per account at runtime and is only readable from the interactive /model picker. Entries below remain as of 2026-04-17."
      - "2026-08-26: both effort option blocks re-verified verbatim against the shipped app.js bundle - all six option descriptions are unchanged."
    providers:
      - name: OpenAI
        shared_options:
          - name: Reasoning effort
            values:
              - name: Low
                notes:
                  - "Faster responses, less detailed reasoning"
              - name: Medium
                notes:
                  - "Balanced speed and reasoning depth"
              - name: High
                notes:
                  - "More thorough reasoning, slower responses"
            default: Medium
        models:
          - name: GPT-5.4
            default: true

          - name: GPT-5.3-Codex

          - name: GPT-5.2-Codex
            options:
              - name: Reasoning effort
                default: High

          - name: GPT-5.2

          - name: GPT-5.4 mini

          - name: GPT-5 mini

          - name: GPT-4.1
            options: []

      - name: Anthropic
        shared_options:
          - name: Effort Level
            values:
              - name: Low
                notes:
                  - "Minimal thinking, prioritizes speed"
              - name: Medium
                notes:
                  - "Balanced, thinks on harder problems"
              - name: High
                notes:
                  - "Optimal performance, thorough thinking"
            default: Medium
        models:
          - name: Claude Sonnet 4.6

          - name: Claude Sonnet 4.5
            options: []

          - name: Claude Haiku 4.5
            options: []

          - name: Claude Opus 4.6

          - name: Claude Opus 4.5
            options: []

          - name: Claude Sonnet 4
            options: []

  - cli: Kilo
    version: 7.4.23
    last_updated: 2026-04-17
    notes:
      - "Source: Kilo model picker output supplied by user."
      - "Entries below preserve picker-visible labels only; runtime maps them to Kilo gateway ids."
      - "2026-08-26: version re-probed as 7.4.23. Picker list NOT re-verified - `kilo models` returns the full 299-entry gateway catalog from models.dev, which is a different artifact: the picker virtual routing rows (Kilo Auto Frontier/Balanced/Free, Elephant) do not appear in it. Entries below remain as of 2026-04-17."
      - "`kilo models --verbose` emits per-model JSON (id, name, family, cost, limit.context, limit.output) and is the better source if this section is ever re-scoped to the gateway catalog rather than the picker."
    models:
      - name: Kilo Auto Frontier

      - name: Kilo Auto Balanced

      - name: Kilo Auto Free

      - name: "xAI: Grok Code Fast 1 Optimized"

      - name: "StepFun: Step 3.5 Flash"

      - name: Elephant

      - name: "Anthropic: Claude Opus 4.7"

      - name: "Anthropic: Claude Sonnet 4.6"

      - name: "OpenAI: GPT-5.4"
        default: true

      - name: "Google: Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview"

      - name: "MiniMax: MiniMax M2.7"

      - name: "MoonshotAI: Kimi K2.5"

      - name: "Z.ai: GLM 5.1"

  - cli: Kiro
    version: 2.19.2
    last_updated: 2026-04-17
    notes:
      - "Source: kiro-cli model list output supplied by user"
      - "2026-08-26: version re-probed as 2.19.2 (kiro-cli-chat). Model list NOT re-verified - the local kiro-cli is logged out and the list is account-gated. Entries below remain as of 2026-04-17."
      - "`kiro-cli chat` also takes `--effort <low|medium|high|xhigh|max>`, which no entry below represents."
    models:
      - name: auto
        notes:
          - "Models chosen by task for optimal usage and consistent quality"
        default: true

      - name: claude-opus-4.6
        notes:
          - "The Claude Opus 4.6 model"

      - name: claude-sonnet-4.6
        notes:
          - "The latest Claude Sonnet model with 1M context window"

      - name: claude-opus-4.5
        notes:
          - "The Claude Opus 4.5 model"

      - name: claude-sonnet-4.5
        notes:
          - "The Claude Sonnet 4.5 model"

      - name: claude-sonnet-4
        notes:
          - "Hybrid reasoning and coding for regular use"

      - name: claude-haiku-4.5
        notes:
          - "The latest Claude Haiku model"

      - name: deepseek-3.2
        notes:
          - "Experimental preview of DeepSeek V3.2"

      - name: minimax-m2.5
        notes:
          - "The MiniMax M2.5 model"

      - name: minimax-m2.1
        notes:
          - "Experimental preview of MiniMax M2.1"

      - name: glm-5
        notes:
          - "The GLM-5 model"

      - name: qwen3-coder-next
        notes:
          - "Experimental preview of Qwen3 Coder Next"

  - cli: Junie
    version: "26.8.24 (2929.5)"
    last_updated: 2026-04-17
    notes:
      - "Source: Junie model picker output supplied by user"
      - "All models routed through JetBrains AI"
      - "2026-08-26: version re-probed as 26.8.24 (2929.5). Model list NOT re-verified - the CLI exposes --model/--provider but has no list command, and an invalid --model fails without enumerating. Entries below remain as of 2026-04-17."
      - "`--provider` accepts openai, anthropic, google, xai, openrouter, copilot, litellm for BYOK; when unset the Junie/Custom provider is used."
    models:
      - name: Gemini 3 Flash
        default: true

      - name: Claude Opus 4.6

      - name: Claude Opus 4.7

      - name: Claude Sonnet 4.6

      - name: Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite

      - name: Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview

      - name: GPT-5

      - name: GPT-5.2

      - name: GPT-5.3-codex

      - name: GPT-5.4

      - name: Grok 4.1 Fast Reasoning
